OL,3,AEthiopia's Virgin Mary festival in
OL,4,ATigray cancelled over drone strike
OL,5,Afears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major cultural and religious festival
OL,8,Fcelebrating women and the Virgin Mary
OL,9,Fin northern Ethiopia has been cancelled
OL,10,Fin Mekelle, the main city in the Tigray
OL,11,Fregion, over fears it may be targeted
OL,12,Fin drone attacks.
OL,14,FThe focal point of Ashenda festival,
OL,15,Fwhich traditionally draws thousands of
OL,16,Fyoung women dressed in their finery,
OL,17,Fwas to be a mass gathering at a stadium
OL,18,Fin Mekelle on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
