OL,3,AEthiopia's Virgin Mary festival in
OL,4,ATigray cancelled over drone strike
OL,5,Afears
OL,6,
OL,7,FTigray is still recovering from a
OL,8,Fbrutal two-year civil war that ended in
OL,9,F2022. There are concerns the conflict
OL,10,Fmight reignite with the regional
OL,11,Fauthorities blaming a recent series of
OL,12,Fdeadly drone strikes on federal armed
OL,13,Fforces.
OL,15,FThe government has not responded to a
OL,16,FBBC request for comment on the
OL,17,Faccusations.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
